<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">DOCTOR VERIFICATION</view><view class="title">先绑定医院，再查看病例</view><view class="subtitle">医生身份、执业资质和医院关系必须由管理员审核。审核通过前不能读取任何宠主病例。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{saved}}" class="notice success">申请已经提交，管理员审核通过后会开通本院权限。</view><view wx:if="{{application}}" class="card status"><view class="row"><view class="list-title">当前申请</view><view class="pill">{{application.status_label}}</view></view><view class="meta">{{application.organization_name}} · {{application.created_at_label}}<br/>审核说明：{{application.review_note || '暂无'}}</view></view><view class="section-title">医院绑定方式</view><view class="switch"><button class="{{mode==='existing'?'primary':'secondary'}}" data-mode="existing" bindtap="mode">选择已有医院</button><button class="{{mode==='new'?'primary':'secondary'}}" data-mode="new" bindtap="mode">申请新建医院</button></view><view class="card"><view wx:if="{{mode==='existing'}}" class="field"><text class="label">已通过平台核验的医院</text><picker range="{{hospitals}}" range-key="name" bindchange="chooseHospital"><view class="picker">点击选择医院</view></picker></view><view wx:else><view class="field"><text class="label">医院法定名称</text><input class="input" data-key="hospitalName" value="{{form.hospitalName}}" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">医院地址</text><input class="input" data-key="address" value="{{form.address}}" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="field"><text class="label">医生真实姓名</text><input class="input" data-key="legalName" value="{{form.legalName}}" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">联系电话</text><input class="input" data-key="phone" value="{{form.phone}}" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">执业兽医资格证号</text><input class="input" data-key="licenseNo" value="{{form.licenseNo}}" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="primary submit" bindtap="submit">提交管理员审核</button></view><view class="bottom-note">证件图片将通过安全对象存储上传；本页面当前先建立结构和审核流程，未配置存储前不会假装上传成功。</view></view>
